/**
 * Week 21 — Oaths / Iuramenta.
 *
 * The oath of office, the swearing-in, the affidavit. What we invoke
 * when we pledge. Aquinas on iuramenta, Augustine on the loose tongue,
 * Roper on More, More's own Tower letters, Blackstone on the gravity
 * of the form, Newman on truthfulness. The week the lawyer remembers
 * that his signature carries the weight of an invocation.
 */
